# ============================================================
# Paste this into: Render dashboard -> smartvote-frontend service
#                   -> Environment tab -> "Add from .env" (paste this line)
# ============================================================
# FILL IN — your BACKEND service's exact URL (from its Render page), e.g.:
# VITE_API_URL=https://smartvote-backend-abcd.onrender.com
VITE_API_URL=https://your-backend-url.onrender.com

# After saving, do a "Manual Deploy" -> "Clear build cache & deploy" on this
# service. Vite bakes this URL into the build at BUILD TIME, so just saving
# the env var alone will NOT update an already-built site.
